PEPSE Simulator (EX4)

A procedural 2D world simulation built in Java using DanoGameLab.
Features a day-night cycle, sun and halo motion, a controllable avatar
with energy and animations, trees with swaying leaves and fruits, and
reproducible infinite world generation.

Packages & Modules:
- pepse: PepseGameManager entry point and game loop orchestration.
- pepse.utils: ColorSupplier and NoiseGenerator utilities.
- pepse.world: Sky, Block, Terrain, and world layer setup.
- pepse.world.daynight: Night opacity transitions and Sun/SunHalo motion.
- pepse.world.avatar: Avatar movement, jumping, energy, and animations.
- pepse.world.trees: Flora, static trunks, leaf sway transitions, and fruits.
